            <td>ADB backup (tar-based); proprietary manufacturer backups</td>
            <td>iTunes/Finder encrypted plist files; iCloud backup</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>App Data Isolation</td>
            <td>Sandbox enforced but can be bypassed with root</td>
